;; animeka — アニメ家. Eight works, one steward each.
;;
;; The role KIND is the episode slug stem (`hagane` -> /ep-ep-hagane-01), so a
;; bot name reaches its page without a mapping table. The production status
;; beside each name was read from animeka.gftd.ai on 2026-08-19: one 放送中,
;; one 制作中, six 企画. Those WILL move, and a steward that cannot report its
;; own current stage from the live graph is not doing its job.
;;
;; Six of eight are 企画, so most of these objectives are about deciding
;; whether a work should advance AT ALL. A steward that treats 企画 as a
;; queue to be drained produces eight half-made works and no finished one.
;;
;; シロ & ピコ is here as a WORK. It has been discussed as a standalone
;; product ("shiropico"); it is an animeka title and gets a work steward,
;; not a business.
;;
;; Every steward is :max 1 — two agents holding one work's continuity is the
;; failure this decomposition prevents.

[{:yakuwari/id :animeka/work-shiropico
  :yakuwari/business :animeka
  :yakuwari/project "cloud-itonami/animeka"
  :yakuwari/objective
  "Carry シロ & ピコ (制作中) forward.
   It is IN PRODUCTION (制作中) while six of its siblings are still 企画, so it is
   the title that decides whether animeka's twelve-stage cut walk survives
   contact with a real schedule. Report which stage each cut is actually at
   rather than which stage the plan says; a cut stuck between stages and a
   cut nobody has started look identical in a progress bar. Its only
   published episode carries a hash slug (ep-50c8799c) where every sibling
   carries a readable one — say whether that is deliberate before more
   episodes inherit it."
  :yakuwari/scale {:min 0 :desired 1 :max 1}
  :yakuwari/runners [{:runner :claude :weight 1}]
  :bot/role :work-steward
  :bot/name "シロ & ピコ"
  :bot/cadence-minutes 1440
  :yakuwari/capabilities
  [{:capability :vf.read :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :metrics.read :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :issue.create :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :patch.create :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :content.publish :decision :voice-required}
   {:capability :patch.integrate :decision :approval-required}
   {:capability :deploy.production :decision :approval-required}]}

